	\L_0382e:
	ZH 1:
	'Maris?'
	R
	'What’s wrong? Why were you'
	R
	'running and looking for me?'
	\L_03953:
	ZH 1:
	'Also, I’m eating right now.'
	R
	'If it’s about work leave it'
	R
	'for later.'
	\L_03953:
	\L_03946:
	\L_0389e:
	ZH 1:
	'...Something terrible happened.'
	\L_03953:
	\L_03946:
	\L_0382e:
	ZH 1:
	'What?'
	\L_03953:
	\L_03946:
	\L_0389e:
	ZH 1:
	'The reserve food all over Leazas'
	R
	'suddenly rotted... All of our'
	R
	'territories are panicking.'
	\L_03953:
	\L_03946:
	\L_0382e:
	ZH 1:
	'What!?'
	R
	'Everywhere in Leazas?'
	\L_03953:
	\L_03946:
	\L_0389e:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes...!'
	\L_03953:
	\L_03946:
	\L_0382e:
	ZH 1:
	'But how did this just suddenly'
	R
	'happen...?'
	\L_03953:
	\L_03946:
	\L_0389e:
	ZH 1:
	'It’s believed to be enemy'
	R
	'sabotage.'
	\L_03953:
	\L_03946:
	\L_0382e:
	ZH 1:
	'An enemy...'
	R
	'Helman?'
	\L_03953:
	\L_03946:
	\L_0389e:
	ZH 1:
	'Most likely.'
	\L_03953:
	\L_03946:
	\L_0382e:
	ZH 1:
	'How could those Helman losers do'
	R
	'this to us!? What were the'
	R
	'guards doing?!!'
	\L_03953:
	ZH 1:
	'They were slacking off!!'
	\L_03953:
	\L_03946:
	\L_0389e:
	ZH 1:
	'I apologize.'
	\L_03953:
	ZH 1:
	'In any case, there’s chaos. They'
	R
	'may start rioting for food.'
	\L_03953:
	ZH 1:
	'We must use our budget to get it'
	R
	'from other nations.'
	\L_03953:
	\L_03946:
	\L_0382e:
	ZH 1:
	'If we have to.'
	R
	'How much will that cost,'
	R
	'though?'
	\L_03953:
	\L_03946:
	\L_0389e:
	ZH 1:
	'It will likely cost most of'
	R
	'our current funds.'
	\L_03953:
	\L_03946:
	\L_0382e:
	ZH 1:
	'What?!'
	R
	'That’s ridiculous!!'
	\L_03953:
	\L_03946:
